  "details": "Now that we have a unique compornent, it would be nice if Constraint could be made to “attach” to other players to make it even better.\n\nHowever, Constraint has a nasty rule that itself must take something as its target.\n\nTherefore, it would be nice if there is a procedure that allows Constraint to be performed only on “parts” that have been pre-registered.\n\nIf this mechanism is realized, it will bring us even closer to practical reproduction of swords and weapons that can be picked up by other players, which has been difficult to track angles in PhysBone.\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)",
